    "title": "How an Ancient Botanical Becomes a Product Category - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Standards ,\n1 days ago A plant can sit in the archaeological record for 3,000 years and still reach a shelf looking new. That gap between deep history and sudden retail presence is a business story. Sourcing, processing and packaging all have to change before a traditional preparation carries a barcode. Operators who follow consumer markets have watched the pattern run through turmeric, ashwagandha and kava. Read full article\n1",
